<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Hello {{.Data.name}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Verify your e-mail address to activate your Koro account.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;"><a href="{{index .Data "link"}}" style="color:#1d4ed8;">Verify my e-mail address</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">The link is valid for {{index .Data "valid_minutes"}} minutes. If the app asks for a code, enter: <code>{{index .Data "token"}}</code></p>
<p style="margin:0;">If you did not sign up, you can ignore this message.</p>
